WEBVTT

00:00:06.890 --> 00:00:08.590
Christmas cakes for sale!

00:00:08.590 --> 00:00:10.130
Hello, would you like to buy a Christmas cake?

00:00:10.130 --> 00:00:11.730
Christmas cakes!

00:00:11.730 --> 00:00:14.360
We have them in cream, chocolate
and melon flavors.

00:00:21.610 --> 00:00:24.010
Did it... I did it!

00:00:24.010 --> 00:00:25.640
Chaos!

00:00:31.720 --> 00:00:33.840
It's gonna take more than that.

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:36.490
What you lack is love.

00:00:36.490 --> 00:00:37.760
Love!

00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:40.380
You've gotta actually enjoy it more.

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:50.800
I pray in the dark

00:00:55.640 --> 00:01:02.600
Just now, as the cold breeze blew against me

00:01:04.150 --> 00:01:11.060
I caught a sudden glimpse of a me that I'd lost

00:01:11.390 --> 00:01:15.630
It's fading away

00:01:15.630 --> 00:01:19.870
Vanishing in the faceless crowd

00:01:19.870 --> 00:01:23.940
My singing voice won't get through

00:01:23.940 --> 00:01:29.170
It will be drowned out

00:01:29.640 --> 00:01:31.740
Answer me

00:01:31.740 --> 00:01:35.950
My prayer is a fleeting wish

00:01:35.950 --> 00:01:40.250
That could vanish any moment

00:01:40.250 --> 00:01:46.690
I can't erase the pain

00:01:46.690 --> 00:01:52.900
But I gather up light with my words

00:01:52.900 --> 00:01:57.200
So it will reach far, far away

00:01:57.200 --> 00:02:03.840
I can't erase the tears, but...

00:02:03.840 --> 00:02:09.440
I pray in the dark

00:02:14.890 --> 00:02:18.050
Yeah, I'll hand out the leaflets to everyone.

00:02:19.220 --> 00:02:22.890
I'll be able to talk to all your friends again, huh?

00:02:22.890 --> 00:02:25.400
I'm really looking forward to it.

00:02:25.400 --> 00:02:29.170
Okay, I'll come meet you at the
Shinjuku bus station at five.

00:02:29.170 --> 00:02:31.200
But Hiyums, you have
remedial classes, don't you?

00:02:31.200 --> 00:02:34.230
Well, yeah, but I'll tell Ms. Alucard.

00:02:35.070 --> 00:02:36.780
I'll be just fine.

00:02:36.780 --> 00:02:39.140
It's not my first time going there.

00:02:39.140 --> 00:02:42.650
Plus, the exhibition hall is closer
to your school anyway, right?

00:02:42.650 --> 00:02:43.650
But...

00:02:43.650 --> 00:02:46.920
I'll really be fine. Okay?

00:02:46.920 --> 00:02:48.820
Yeah, okay.

00:02:49.990 --> 00:02:52.260
Okay, see you tomorrow.

00:02:52.260 --> 00:02:54.420
Yup, goodnight.

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:11.740
The Sixth Night

00:03:12.440 --> 00:03:13.270
Stars of Fate Chapter

00:03:14.280 --> 00:03:16.980
Story of Byakko ~
A Mirthless Christmas Eve

00:03:16.980 --> 00:03:19.150
Haneda Airport <-> Shinjuku
(via Marunouchi)

00:03:19.150 --> 00:03:23.690
Haneda Airport <-> Shinjuku
(via Marunouchi)
Hiyums says that he and his friends ate up
those strawberries I sent last week.

00:03:23.690 --> 00:03:24.490
Haneda Airport <-> Shinjuku
(via Marunouchi)
My, my!

00:03:24.490 --> 00:03:24.960
My, my!

00:03:24.960 --> 00:03:29.520
They finished them off in less
than ten minutes, he said.

00:03:30.700 --> 00:03:32.600
Well, I'm glad they enjoyed them.

00:03:32.600 --> 00:03:34.660
That's what matters most.

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:36.970
Strawberry
Dorayaki

00:03:37.300 --> 00:03:39.910
Perhaps, they'll be gone in
five minutes this time.

00:03:39.910 --> 00:03:41.770
Did you say something?

00:03:41.770 --> 00:03:44.400
Oh, nothing, nothing at all.

00:03:45.410 --> 00:03:45.740
Here you go.

00:03:45.740 --> 00:03:46.710
Shintendo School
Neotraditional Craft Show
Here you go.

00:03:46.710 --> 00:03:47.050
Shintendo School
Neotraditional Craft Show
Here...

00:03:47.050 --> 00:03:48.750
Shintendo School
Neotraditional Craft Show
Shintendo School
Neotraditional Craft Show
Here...

00:03:48.750 --> 00:03:49.550
Here...

00:03:49.550 --> 00:03:51.180
Here!

00:03:53.850 --> 00:03:58.960
Wow! So, these are the kinds of bowls
your father makes?

00:03:58.960 --> 00:04:01.860
It kinda makes me feel warm inside.

00:04:01.860 --> 00:04:04.950
Yeah, his personality shows through
nicely in his work.

00:04:05.960 --> 00:04:08.600
Honestly, this is all over my head.

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:11.830
This would be the absolute best
to serve chicken stew in!

00:04:12.570 --> 00:04:16.040
Say, where are you going to
meet up with your folks?

00:04:16.040 --> 00:04:18.280
Right at the exhibition.

00:04:18.280 --> 00:04:21.980
Then, would you mind if I take
just a few little pictures?

00:04:21.980 --> 00:04:24.320
"The Mysterious Transfer Student:
A Tearful Reunion!"

00:04:24.320 --> 00:04:26.150
Now, that'll sell!

00:04:26.150 --> 00:04:28.820
Anko, don't go butting in on
Tatsuma and his parents.

00:04:28.820 --> 00:04:30.890
It's not nice.

00:04:30.890 --> 00:04:32.490
Oh, c'mon!

00:04:32.490 --> 00:04:34.330
Not at the same old bus station?

00:04:34.330 --> 00:04:35.330
Yeah...

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:37.630
But if I can make it in time, I will.

00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:44.770
So, uh, who's that behind you?

00:04:44.770 --> 00:04:46.440
Um, well...

00:04:46.440 --> 00:04:48.570
Oh, Tatsuma!

00:04:48.570 --> 00:04:51.210
Introducing me to your parents already?

00:04:51.210 --> 00:04:52.540
You're taking this too fast!

00:04:52.540 --> 00:04:54.650
What the hell are you doing here?

00:04:54.650 --> 00:04:56.610
I hate you, you big barbarian!

00:04:57.250 --> 00:04:58.880
Y..You little...

00:05:20.940 --> 00:05:22.570
Hey, hey, hey!

00:05:30.050 --> 00:05:31.850
Did it again...

00:05:34.050 --> 00:05:36.120
Tenryuin High School

00:05:36.120 --> 00:05:38.260
Tenryuin High School
You were perfect right up to making the shot!

00:05:38.260 --> 00:05:40.060
Tenryuin High School
Nice try, Ryuji!

00:05:40.060 --> 00:05:41.190
Damn!

00:05:41.190 --> 00:05:43.660
Those jerks are enjoying my misfortune.

00:05:45.300 --> 00:05:48.000
So, like, where's this girlfriend of
yours I've been hearing about?

00:05:48.000 --> 00:05:50.300
Her? Over there.

00:05:51.340 --> 00:05:53.640
That's a high school model right there!

00:05:53.640 --> 00:05:55.640
Whoa! Check out them long legs!

00:05:55.640 --> 00:05:57.910
Ryuji, we all gotta party together!
Make it happen!

00:05:57.910 --> 00:06:00.540
What? Are you serious?

00:06:01.750 --> 00:06:04.420
I'm begging you, man! Please!

00:06:04.420 --> 00:06:06.380
Jeez... I'll ask her.

00:06:06.380 --> 00:06:08.790
You truly are a helluva a guy!

00:06:08.790 --> 00:06:10.690
Can't breathe...

00:06:13.260 --> 00:06:18.720
Sakuragaoka
Central
Hospital

00:06:20.730 --> 00:06:22.360
It's such a pain...

00:06:24.270 --> 00:06:27.910
Sakuragaoka
Central
Hospital

00:06:27.910 --> 00:06:29.740
Sakuragaoka
Central
Hospital
Uh... Um...

00:06:36.620 --> 00:06:38.710
Huh? What's that?!

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:41.550
Maiko, keep hold of her other hand.

00:06:41.550 --> 00:06:42.650
Okay!

00:06:42.650 --> 00:06:44.450
This is a really advanced case.

00:06:45.020 --> 00:06:49.980
Jeez, why couldn't they have just brought her in
instead of beating around the bush?

00:06:50.360 --> 00:06:51.960
What the heck is going on here?!

00:06:51.960 --> 00:06:53.060
Give us a hand, quick!

00:06:53.060 --> 00:06:54.500
Earn your damn keep!

00:06:54.500 --> 00:06:56.130
Y..Yes, ma'am!

00:06:56.840 --> 00:06:58.460
S..She's strong!

00:06:59.200 --> 00:07:00.830
Chaos...

00:07:01.310 --> 00:07:02.930
Chaos...

00:07:22.190 --> 00:07:25.030
I'll bet Hiyu's mother would like
something like this.

00:07:25.030 --> 00:07:26.730
What? Which one?

00:07:26.730 --> 00:07:28.800
Ah, I think I know which one you mean.

00:07:28.800 --> 00:07:31.770
Yeah, she's a "cute" kind of person!

00:07:33.410 --> 00:07:33.640
RAMEN

00:07:33.640 --> 00:07:37.410
RAMEN
Wait! Tatsuma can't do anything without me!

00:07:37.410 --> 00:07:38.140
Wait! Tatsuma can't do anything without me!

00:07:41.110 --> 00:07:43.950
She's got more firepower than any
gas stove you'll ever see.

00:07:44.450 --> 00:07:47.890
I'm sure you'll be able to make the ultimate
Chinese pepper steak with her!

00:07:47.890 --> 00:07:49.850
Well, we'll let ya get to it then.

00:07:54.760 --> 00:07:57.300
Still a little too early to go to the exhibit, huh?

00:07:57.300 --> 00:08:01.970
Well, let's go kill some time by grabbing
a bite to eat or something.

00:08:01.970 --> 00:08:03.590
You got it.

00:08:31.160 --> 00:08:33.700
Someone will be here for me soon.

00:08:33.700 --> 00:08:35.970
I wouldn't want to trouble you.

00:08:35.970 --> 00:08:38.140
No, it's no trouble.

00:08:38.140 --> 00:08:39.840
I really appreciate it.

00:08:39.840 --> 00:08:42.440
You know, you've got amazing reflexes.

00:08:42.440 --> 00:08:44.570
I'm really impressed!

00:08:45.180 --> 00:08:48.280
You were so explosive; it was so cool.

00:08:48.280 --> 00:08:50.250
I'm kinda jealous.

00:08:50.750 --> 00:08:52.420
Oh, there she is!

00:08:52.420 --> 00:08:54.410
Over here, Mom!

00:08:59.590 --> 00:09:01.560
Thanks again.

00:09:03.130 --> 00:09:05.430
Well, have a merry Christmas.

00:09:17.510 --> 00:09:19.880
Are you Hiyu's father and mother?

00:09:19.880 --> 00:09:21.510
Yes, we are.

00:09:21.910 --> 00:09:23.210
And you are?

00:09:23.210 --> 00:09:27.390
Hiyu asked me to come and get you.

00:09:27.390 --> 00:09:30.260
Oh, you're one of his friends, are you?

00:09:30.260 --> 00:09:33.260
And I told him not to worry.

00:09:33.260 --> 00:09:37.100
That's Tatsuma, ever the thoughtful one.

00:09:37.100 --> 00:09:42.900
Well, thank you very much for going out of
your way after school like this.

00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:46.130
I'll take you to where Hiyu is.

00:10:01.420 --> 00:10:04.050
Watch your step, dear.

00:10:05.020 --> 00:10:06.650
Yes, dear.

00:10:07.130 --> 00:10:09.090
Oh, of course!

00:10:10.360 --> 00:10:12.160
Please have one if you'd like.

00:10:12.160 --> 00:10:14.530
These have strawberry filling.

00:10:14.530 --> 00:10:16.830
I hope you'll like it.

00:10:34.020 --> 00:10:35.820
Why not wait inside?

00:10:35.820 --> 00:10:37.620
You'll only catch a chill outside.

00:10:38.120 --> 00:10:39.320
I'm fine.

00:10:39.320 --> 00:10:41.290
I'll just wait here a little longer.

00:11:03.950 --> 00:11:06.580
Um, pardon me...

00:11:06.780 --> 00:11:09.580
but do we have much farther to go?

00:11:15.690 --> 00:11:17.490
Um, could you...

00:11:26.870 --> 00:11:29.670
It's Christmas,

00:11:29.670 --> 00:11:31.840
and you bring this instead of cake?!

00:12:48.190 --> 00:12:50.810
You're certain these are your parents?

00:12:56.230 --> 00:12:59.890
Each of them died from a direct
wound to the heart.

00:13:00.300 --> 00:13:02.770
Both of them were stabbed multiple times.

00:13:02.770 --> 00:13:04.740
Your father fifteen times;

00:13:04.740 --> 00:13:07.470
your mother, twenty-three.

00:13:07.470 --> 00:13:09.440
That, plus the other injuries...

00:13:12.740 --> 00:13:15.710
Mr. Mikuriya, do you have a moment?

00:13:16.080 --> 00:13:17.710
Yeah...

00:13:18.380 --> 00:13:20.850
He was brought in just now.

00:13:23.550 --> 00:13:24.560
And?

00:13:24.560 --> 00:13:27.990
He has nothing on him that
would show his identity,

00:13:27.990 --> 00:13:30.400
but he is wearing a Magami High uniform.

00:13:30.400 --> 00:13:31.630
What's that supposed to mean?

00:13:31.630 --> 00:13:35.570
Ah, well, he doesn't appear to be a
current student there or a graduate,

00:13:35.570 --> 00:13:37.270
and we're not sure how he got
hold of a Magami uniform.

00:13:37.270 --> 00:13:38.740
Is it another one of those cases?

00:13:38.740 --> 00:13:42.190
Mr. Mikuriya, for now please come to the
second floor interrogation room.

00:13:44.640 --> 00:13:46.270
Hey!

00:13:59.690 --> 00:14:01.490
What kind of look is that?

00:14:04.260 --> 00:14:06.060
You crack me up!

00:14:07.270 --> 00:14:08.890
Hey, stop!

00:14:09.130 --> 00:14:10.760
YOU!

00:14:17.640 --> 00:14:19.940
GET OFF!

00:14:36.030 --> 00:14:38.930
Everyone's a damn coward.

00:14:38.930 --> 00:14:42.370
None of them were any use,

00:14:42.370 --> 00:14:46.000
so I killed the two old hicks instead.

00:14:49.340 --> 00:14:51.410
You watching this, Chaos?

00:14:51.410 --> 00:14:52.740
Chaos?

00:14:52.740 --> 00:14:55.870
So, now the title of Chaos is mine!

00:14:57.220 --> 00:14:58.840
Ain't that right?

00:15:10.060 --> 00:15:11.960
At approximately 5:00 pm,

00:15:11.960 --> 00:15:14.900
a potter and his wife, who had come to
Tokyo to attend a crafts exhibit,

00:15:14.900 --> 00:15:16.570
were fatally stabbed by an
unemployed transient

00:15:16.570 --> 00:15:19.540
on a street in the third district of Shinjuku.

00:15:19.540 --> 00:15:21.510
What a disturbing story...
The man in question is presently in police
custody at the Kabukicho Police Station.

00:15:21.510 --> 00:15:24.010
There's been a lot of stuff like that lately.
The man in question is presently in police
custody at the Kabukicho Police Station.

00:15:24.010 --> 00:15:24.980
Yeah, no kidding.
The man in question is presently in police
custody at the Kabukicho Police Station.

00:15:24.980 --> 00:15:26.380
Yeah, no kidding.
Police are looking into the suspect's...

00:15:26.380 --> 00:15:29.880
What's the matter with Japan?
Police are looking into the suspect's...

00:15:29.880 --> 00:15:30.250
Police are looking into the suspect's...

00:15:38.920 --> 00:15:39.920
Where's Anko?

00:15:39.920 --> 00:15:42.720
Oh, I took her home.

00:15:48.430 --> 00:15:51.060
So, things like this happen even to us.

00:15:52.470 --> 00:15:54.540
No, that's not right.

00:15:54.540 --> 00:15:57.010
The truth is that we've known all along.

00:15:57.010 --> 00:16:01.310
We knew that someone's family
might get caught up in this.

00:16:01.310 --> 00:16:02.940
That's enough!

00:16:03.380 --> 00:16:06.350
It just happened to be Hiyu this time.

00:16:06.680 --> 00:16:07.950
But next time...

00:16:07.950 --> 00:16:10.620
Next time, it could be my family they go after!

00:16:10.620 --> 00:16:12.250
Komaki!

00:16:32.540 --> 00:16:34.170
Tatsuma...

00:16:42.690 --> 00:16:44.020
Hiyu...

00:16:44.020 --> 00:16:45.120
Hey, Tatsuma!

00:16:45.120 --> 00:16:46.420
Hiyu?

00:16:46.790 --> 00:16:48.420
Hiyu!

00:16:49.530 --> 00:16:50.800
Hey!

00:16:50.800 --> 00:16:51.830
Tatsuma...

00:16:51.830 --> 00:16:54.490
Tatsuma!

00:17:24.860 --> 00:17:26.900
Mic check, 1, 2!

00:17:26.900 --> 00:17:27.900
Okay!

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:30.970
This is our last high school Christmas,

00:17:30.970 --> 00:17:33.960
so let's get hoppin' all around the land...

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:37.040
My, my, Number 8...

00:17:37.040 --> 00:17:40.210
You really did a swell job.

00:17:40.210 --> 00:17:42.380
And so I grant you...

00:17:42.380 --> 00:17:45.010
the title of Chaos.

00:17:46.620 --> 00:17:48.790
Hey, whatcha doing there, Ryuji?

00:17:48.790 --> 00:17:50.410
C'mon, you sing!

00:17:55.890 --> 00:17:57.400
Where is Houraiji?

00:17:57.400 --> 00:18:00.160
I tried to call him, but I couldn't get through.

00:18:00.160 --> 00:18:01.830
We've no time to wait for him.

00:18:01.830 --> 00:18:02.830
Sagaya...

00:18:02.830 --> 00:18:04.460
Right!

00:18:06.040 --> 00:18:07.410
A cell phone game?

00:18:07.410 --> 00:18:09.540
Yes, well...

00:18:09.540 --> 00:18:13.610
There's this bulletin board I use to visit.

00:18:13.610 --> 00:18:17.080
There are a lot of people there who post
about how they hate the world,

00:18:17.080 --> 00:18:19.710
or how they want to get revenge on
some person or other.

00:18:20.790 --> 00:18:24.260
On this board, there's this person
called "Dark Charisma".

00:18:24.260 --> 00:18:27.430
The rumor was, if you got an
email from that person,

00:18:27.430 --> 00:18:30.390
the people you wanted to murder
would die for real.

00:18:32.600 --> 00:18:35.930
Then one day, that person got
in touch with me...

00:18:39.570 --> 00:18:40.540
I'll kill you first!
I know how you feel. Kill 'em.
Juvenile law says we're...

00:18:42.870 --> 00:18:46.140
C'mon, don't hang around there.

00:18:46.140 --> 00:18:48.280
Let's be buds!

00:18:48.280 --> 00:18:52.150
You're probably bored being all alone, Sagaya.

00:18:54.320 --> 00:18:59.760
That voice echoing in my head freaked me out,
so I threw out my computer.

00:19:00.560 --> 00:19:03.760
So, you're saying this "Dark Charisma"
is our "Chaos."

00:19:03.760 --> 00:19:05.430
Yes!

00:19:05.430 --> 00:19:08.370
I believe those people who received
messages from Chaos

00:19:08.370 --> 00:19:10.360
have fallen under his control and
are killing people.

00:19:11.240 --> 00:19:14.000
Including whoever owned this phone.

00:19:14.000 --> 00:19:19.470
People on that bulletin board have already
posted stuff about Hiyu's parents.

00:19:20.040 --> 00:19:23.840
Hiyu may have already set out to find Chaos.

00:19:29.450 --> 00:19:30.450
We've got to stop him!

00:19:30.450 --> 00:19:31.460
But why?

00:19:31.460 --> 00:19:33.390
If we do, then someone else...

00:19:33.390 --> 00:19:36.760
Hiyu doesn't know his enemy has power!

00:19:37.500 --> 00:19:39.200
We won't accomplish anything here.

00:19:39.200 --> 00:19:40.990
We must hurry.

00:19:41.230 --> 00:19:43.200
Hiyu Tatsuma

00:19:44.240 --> 00:19:46.000
This is no time for me to sit around crying.

00:19:46.000 --> 00:19:48.300
I've gotta do what I can!

00:20:12.460 --> 00:20:14.520
Stop right there, bro.

00:20:15.200 --> 00:20:19.000
Now, you know you need lD
to get in here, don't ya?

00:20:23.510 --> 00:20:25.640
What the hell was that for?!

00:20:25.640 --> 00:20:27.270
Where is he?

00:20:28.250 --> 00:20:29.870
Where's Chaos?!

00:20:34.190 --> 00:20:35.810
What's going on?

00:20:36.790 --> 00:20:38.410
Let's get outta here!

00:20:41.790 --> 00:20:43.420
Where is he?

00:20:44.030 --> 00:20:45.830
I don't know what you're talking about!

00:20:45.830 --> 00:20:48.130
There's no "Chaos" here!

00:20:48.970 --> 00:20:50.840
St..Stop, man!

00:20:50.840 --> 00:20:53.460
I really don't know what you're talking about!

00:21:04.980 --> 00:21:08.440
You really want a fight that bad, Tatsuma?

00:21:13.220 --> 00:21:14.990
Don't get in my way.

00:21:14.990 --> 00:21:16.430
I don't think so.

00:21:16.430 --> 00:21:18.050
I'm gonna get in your way.

00:21:22.400 --> 00:21:25.240
Misato, Kisaragi asked me to help.

00:21:25.240 --> 00:21:27.860
It could be this club called Sarang Hae.

00:21:29.070 --> 00:21:30.700
Hiyu...

00:22:00.340 --> 00:22:01.740
Stop!

00:22:01.740 --> 00:22:03.540
Cut it out...

00:22:07.180 --> 00:22:08.800
Aoi!

00:22:09.850 --> 00:22:11.470
You okay?

00:22:12.450 --> 00:22:14.750
Tatsuma, you sonnuva...

00:22:18.620 --> 00:22:19.620
Tatsuma!

00:22:19.620 --> 00:22:22.420
Hiyu! Please, wait!

00:22:22.990 --> 00:22:24.620
Hiyu!

00:22:41.750 --> 00:22:46.850
I sadly hung my head a bit

00:22:46.850 --> 00:22:51.550
And finally you murmured

00:22:51.960 --> 00:22:56.190
What I heard was a faint goodbye

00:22:56.190 --> 00:23:01.130
Said with all your might

00:23:03.070 --> 00:23:12.340
Our pulses echo in the awkward silence

00:23:12.340 --> 00:23:14.210
We can see each other again

00:23:14.210 --> 00:23:16.710
Let's meet up again some time

00:23:16.710 --> 00:23:22.520
Let's each set out in search of our own futures

00:23:22.520 --> 00:23:27.020
For the kindness you gave me for my heartache

00:23:27.020 --> 00:23:31.460
I thank you now

00:23:32.630 --> 00:23:37.270
These flower petals seem just as if

00:23:37.270 --> 00:23:38.700
They were blessing us

00:23:38.700 --> 00:23:42.910
As we depart on our journeys

00:23:42.910 --> 00:23:47.280
I won't forget your warmth

00:23:47.280 --> 00:23:51.740
That overwhelmed my loneliness

00:23:52.550 --> 00:23:57.650
I thank you now

00:24:06.500 --> 00:24:07.400
Next Episode

00:24:10.000 --> 00:24:12.700
The Seventh Night
Stars of Fate Chapter
Story of Genbu ~
Chaos
